<v Narrator>N'oge mbụ, nye kọmputa ego ike n'ihu, ma nweta azịza kacha mma n'ime nke ahụ.

2
00:00:06.252 --> 00:00:14.852
<v Narrator>Nke abụọ, a tiny nri tag nwere ike  refuse routine radio chatter na freezing cargo ka nchekwa alerts ebi ndụ.

3
